      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Dearest,\n\nThe __________ has finally broken over the orchard, and I
    found myself thinking of you at the __________ hour. I still remember the way
    you __________ when Father spoke about the harvest. The house feels __________
    without your footsteps on the stair.\n\nYesterday I walked out to the __________
    and left a stone where we used to sit. I suppose that is a __________ thing to
    do. Write back when you can. I will be __________ until then.\n\n                                                      
    Ever yours,\n                                                       __________"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e3415a25d2f252c418b7b4b31a195fc9, type: 2}
